config PROFILE_ARM64
    prompt "Target profile"
    type choice
    var ROSCONFIG_PROFILE
    value generic "Generic ARM64"
    value profile_raspberry "Raspberry Pi 3/5"
    default generic
    depends ARCH=arm64
    help
      Generic builds the architecture-independent ARM64 target.

      Raspberry Pi 3/5 includes firmware, device trees and drivers for both
      boards: SD/SDIO, DWC2, SMSC95xx and RP1 Ethernet, CYW43xx Wi-Fi,
      display, OpenGL and audio. Hardware IDs select the matching driver.
      The pinned Windows 10 BSP source snapshot is included for parity work.
      Optional image contents are selected independently in the Image contents
      and tests submenu.
